{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"154073","name":"Riad Sable Chaud","description":"This romantic and sophisticated establishment boasts a convenient position close to all the main places of interest that the magical and interesting city of Marrakech has to offer, such as Bab Doukkala 5 minutes away, as well as Souk’s baazars and the famous Jemaa el Fnaa a few steps away. Menara - Marrakech Airport is less than 5 km away. If travellers want to sunbathe they can do it at the furnished terrace with sunloungers and to relax they will find a small indoor pool. Guest rooms are decorated in an individual and unique style, include exclusive amenities and maintain the typical Moroccan flair, making it possible for its guests to feel completely at ease and enjoy a good night’s sleep.","address":"135 Derb Jdidba Doukala Medina Marrakech, 135 2","city":"MARRAKECH","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.6341685759355,"lng":-7.99663423094898,"stars":4,"giataCode":"132687","phone":"+212 666983006","email":"info@riadsablechaud.com","website":"www.riadsablechaud.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_007_20260505_153450.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a_hb_a_008_20260505_153453.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154073/154073a